@startuml togaf-application
title TOGAF 应用架构（Phase C）- WhatsFeed
skinparam shadowing false

archimate #Business "信息流与帖子" as CapFeed <<business-capability>>
archimate #Business "即时通讯" as CapMsg <<business-capability>>
archimate #Business "探索与推荐" as CapExplore <<business-capability>>

archimate #Application "Web App" as Web <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Mobile App" as Mobile <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Admin App" as Admin <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "NestJS API" as Api <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Recommendation" as Rec <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Vision" as Vision <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Media Gen" as Media <<application-component>>
archimate #Application "Explore AI BFF" as Bff <<application-function>>

archimate #Application "REST API" as IfRest <<application-interface>>
archimate #Application "GraphQL" as IfGql <<application-interface>>
archimate #Application "WebSocket" as IfWs <<application-interface>>

Web --> IfRest : Serving
Web --> IfGql : Serving
Web --> IfWs : Serving
Mobile --> IfRest : Serving
Mobile --> IfGql : Serving
Mobile --> IfWs : Serving
Admin --> IfRest : Serving

IfRest --> Api : Serving
IfGql --> Api : Serving
IfWs --> Api : Serving

Api --> CapFeed : Realization
Api --> CapMsg : Realization
Rec --> CapExplore : Realization
Api --> Rec : Serving
Api --> Vision : Serving
Api --> Media : Serving
Api --> Bff : Serving

note right of Api
  与 C4 Container 对齐：
  apps/web、apps/mobile、apps/admin、
  services/server 及旁路 Python 服务
end note

@enduml
